Load `docs/ai/entry-point.md` first.

Use minimal context.
For code change load:
1. `docs/ai/architecture/code-map.md`
2. `docs/ai/architecture/feature-boundaries.md`
3. `docs/ai/file-index/repository-map.md`
4. relevant workflow
5. related tests
6. target files

TDD mandatory for behavior change.
Write failing test before production code.
Update `docs/ai/file-index/repository-map.md` and affected `docs/ai/architecture/*` after code change.
